# Third-party licenses

Quantus itself is released under the MIT license, see `LICENSE`. It is built on the open source
projects listed here, under the licenses below. This file covers the firmware of the handheld
(`firmware/handheld`, with the engine and the apps); the desktop app has its own list in the
repository root. It is generated: run `npm run licenses`
in `desktop/`, don't edit it by hand.

